	(text "Isolation barrier: everything left of the isolator body is USB / MCU domain, right is 24 V field domain.\nField-side isolator supply is the TSR 5 V rail; no isolated DC/DC is needed because the 24 V adapter is\nitself floating (SELV) w.r.t. USB.  Barrier crossing parts: U2, U3 (digital), U4 + 19 x TLP291-4 (opto)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 400 0)
		(effects
			(font
